CONTROLS:

"The Game is purely using keyboard as a controller"

SELECT: Enter Row and Col to select a tile.
DIG: Select and enter 'd' to dig the selected tile.
FLAG: Select and enter 'f' to flag the selected tile.
UNFLAG: Select a flagged tile and flag it again to unflag it.

HOW TO PLAY:

Start with digging any tile.
When you DIG you get CLUE as a number in the tile.
The number shows number of mines hidden under adjacent tiles.
If there is no number in dug tile all tiles around it are clear.
Mark any suspected mine tile as FLAG.
If you think your suspected mine tile is clear, UNFLAG it.

You cannot dig or flag any tile which is already dug.

If you dig all the clear tiles without digging any mine tiles, you win.
But be careful not to dig any mine tile,
it will trigger all the mines and you will lose the game.
Best Of Luck!

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

There are three levels for this game- 
Beginner - 7 * 7 Board and 7 Mines
Intermediate - 9 * 9 Board and 13 Mines
Advanced - 11 * 11 Board and 22 Mines

Probability of finding a mine - 
Beginner  level -  7/49 (0.14)
Intermediate level - 13/81 (0.16)
Advanced level - 22/121 (0.18)

